Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.43,0:01:21.64,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur8\3c&H000000&\t(292,375,\3c&HFFEB75&)\t(1293,1293,\3c&H000000&)\t(1544,1627,\3c&HFFEB75&)\t(2169,2169,\3c&H000000&)\t(2420,2502,\3c&HFFEB75&)\t(3211,3211,\3c&H000000&)\t(3504,3587,\3c&HFFEB75&)\t(4963,4963,\3c&H000000&)\t(5214,5297,\3c&HFFEB75&)\t(6131,6131,\3c&H000000&)\t(6340,6423,\3c&HFFEB75&)}即使无人知晓 美丽也不会褪色
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.64,0:01:25.06,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur8\3c&HE3861E&\t(0,3000,\3c&HD2F9FC&)}无需再辩解
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.06,0:01:29.77,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur8}哭着走向你的房间
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.77,0:01:34.49,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur8}滴滴眼泪落在地板
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.49,0:01:39.37,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur8}我不能永远做一个小孩
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.37,0:01:44.12,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur8}不明白自己的价值所在
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.12,0:01:48.96,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur8}我不会再担忧内心空虚
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.96,0:01:53.72,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur8}我不会再害怕失去什么
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.72,0:01:58.51,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur8}因为我已经知道
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.51,0:02:03.06,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur8}自己才是自己的解药
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.06,0:02:07.81,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur8}顺从命运的安排走下去
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.81,0:02:12.65,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur8}哪怕前路看不到尽头
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.65,0:02:17.11,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur8}王座再好 如何教人安坐
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.11,0:02:22.83,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\blur8}那毕竟不是自己的选择
